Description: helper to enable Tamil input methods in IBus
 The Tamil 99 and Tamil Phonetic layouts ship with ibus-m17n, but enabling
 them means knowing which input source to add. This package provides
 tamil-keyboard-setup, a small command that adds either layout to your
 desktop input sources for you.
 .
 The command runs as your normal user in your own session, so it works on
 both Wayland and X11, and leaves your existing input sources in place
 rather than replacing them.
